        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>Name</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::object::COFFShortExport::Name</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The name of the export as specified in the .def file or on the command line, i.e. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;foo&quot; in &quot;/EXPORT:foo&quot;, and &quot;bar&quot; in &quot;/EXPORT:foo=bar&quot;. This may lack mangling, such as underscore prefixing and stdcall suffixing. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
